Subject: [ReXGlue] wwe2k14 Session 14 (S3 slow-motion experiment): gpu_vblank_rate_override_hz (default 0 = off) feeds the guest vblank at a chosen rate while vsync is on

Class: 2K14 (generic mechanism)
What: Feed the guest vblank at a chosen rate while vsync is on (slow motion for titles that step a fixed amount per frame).
Evidence: Runs 1059 / 1060: match clock follows the rate exactly.
On / off: gpu_vblank_rate_override_hz (0 = off).
Commit: 32fae13 (diff against 32fae13^1)
Prepared by the WWE 2K14 recomp project (Session 15, prep only, not sent). Measured on one PC (Ryzen 9 5950X, RTX 4090), Vulkan backend, one title.

